{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52158","headline":"五言侍宴延庆殿集同赋得花间鸟一首应诏 · 许敬宗","name":"五言侍宴延庆殿集同赋得花间鸟一首应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落花飞禁蓹，时鸟咔芳晨。\n飘香入绮殿，流响度天津。\n千笑千娇切，一啭一惊新。\n方知物华处，偏在上林春。\n（同前）（按：本诗原署：「中书侍郎臣许敬宗上。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}